        "color": 3,
        "width": 360,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## Credentials & Security\nOAuth2 for Google Sheets and Gmail, API key for OpenAI. Keep the Zoom secret token out of shared copies and restrict the sheet, since it holds client session notes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
